      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "Traces is a platform for capturing and sharing full sessions from AI coding agents like Cursor, Claude Code, and Codex. It records prompts, reasoning, tool use, and intent—the \"why\" behind code changes—beyond just Git diffs.\n\nLaunched Feb 2026 by Tarun Sachdeva, it hit ~500k shared sessions. Today it joins Vercel so the team can keep building agent collaboration tools there. Existing users keep full access."
